      "task": "Find and book the mobeds first. Outside India there are very few, and two are required for the Ashirvad"
    },
    {
      "id": "t1",
      "mb": 14,
      "critical": true,
      "when": "Jul 2026",
      "task": "If you are marrying in India, book the baug — the traditional venues go a year or more ahead"
    },
    {
      "id": "t2",
      "mb": 13,
      "critical": true,
      "when": "Aug 2026",
      "task": "Decide the legal plan: in India, registration is under the Parsi Marriage and Divorce Act 1936; elsewhere you will need a separate civil ceremony"
    },
    {
      "id": "t3",
      "mb": 12,
      "critical": true,
      "when": "Sept 2026",
      "task": "If either of you is not Zoroastrian, ask the mobeds directly and early whether they will officiate — practice on intermarriage differs sharply between and within communities"
    },
    {
      "id": "t4",
      "mb": 11,
      "critical": true,
      "when": "Oct 2026",
      "task": "Find a caterer who can cook a proper bhonu, and book them — there are very few outside the community"
    },
